This repository is an independent .NET integration for OpenUSD. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by Pixar, Unity, NVIDIA, or the Alliance for OpenUSD.

The native runtime is built from Pixar OpenUSD, licensed under the Apache License 2.0. Exact source
URLs, revisions, and archive SHA-256 hashes are pinned in eng/openusd.lock.json and
eng/openusd.install.lock.json.
Project-owned SDK modifications are identified by eng/openusd-runtime-patches.lock.json, including
exact source pre/post hashes. Their profile and full license provenance remain bound to the native
build, complete redistribution notices, and release SBOM.

Runtime packages also include THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md generated from the locked native install.
Those notices provide attribution and license text. The release also publishes
`openusd-release.cdx.json`, a generated CycloneDX software bill of materials (SBOM) that lists the
published package and Viewer components, pinned native inputs, central NuGet package versions, and
vcpkg components resolved from the locked baseline. The Viewer bundle is self-contained; the SBOM
records the .NET runtime as SDK-resolved because the repository pins the SDK but not the restored
runtime pack patch.

The locked OpenUSD native runtime profile additionally enables these direct third-party components:

